cargo-for-each (0.1.1-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Features - config - Allow adding Manifests to config and listing crates and workspaces
  * Features - config - Do not add crates/workspaces if they already exist in the config
  * Features - refresh - Add a refresh subcommand that updates crate types and new workspace members
  * Features - tracing - Add log messages on debug level about add/refresh activity
  * Features - exec - Add the exec subcommand, the main purpose of this cargo plugin
  * Features - exec - Add crate type filter to list and exec crates subcommands
  * Features - config - Store standalone status and workspace manifest in config
  * Features - standalone - Filter by standalone status
  * Features - target_sets - Add the ability to abstract target sets
  * Features - plan - Add plan subcommand to create plans of multiple commands to run
  * Features - task - Add commands to create/delete tasks from plan and target set
  * Features - dependencies - Add dependencies inside the task resolved target set
  * Features - target - Add a target subcommand and move the existing commands there
  * Features - run - Implement task run
  * Features - run - Consider dependencies in task run
  * Features - environment - Get all environment data at the start in preparation for testing
  * Features - tests - Basic test logic and first example test
  * Features - tests - Capture test output
  * Features - tasks - Add list, describe and rewind sub-commands for task
  * Features - targetsets - Add describe command for target-set
  * Features - step-position - Introduce StepPosition type for nested step addressing
  * Features - condition - Introduce Condition type for plan control flow
  * Features - plans - Introduce IfElseIf step type with conditional branching
  * Features - plans - Add CLI sub-commands for IfElseIf step management
  * Features - condition - Add FileExists condition variant
  * Features - condition - Add WorkingDirectoryClean condition variant
  * Features - program - Add snapshot_metadata statement and \${} string interpolation
  * Features - condition - Git config string comparison permission, e.g. to check if the repository has a specific commit message format set in its git config
  * Features - program - Add with_env_file block to load env vars from a file for nested statements
  * Features - program - Print each run step command with full arguments before execution
  * Features - describe - Annotate program listing with cursor, completion status, and branch info
  * Features - wait_for_continue - Add wait barrier statement and task continue command
  * Features - task_create - Add --workspace and --crate flags for explicit target selection
  * Features - crate_types - Add cdylib, dylib, rlib, staticlib, bench, test, example, custom_build crate type filters
  * Features - execution - Print statement type and condition details during execution
  * Features - resolve - Soft dev-dep ordering via SCC-aware cycle breaking
  * Features - check - Add read-only audit subcommand
  * Features - parser - Accept \\ as backslash escape in string literals
  * Bug fixes - workspaces - Add test and fix full workflow for workspaces
  * Bug fixes - target_sets - Do not use dependencies when looking for package definitions
  * Bug fixes - tasks - Simplistic escape mechanism for command arguments
  * Bug fixes - targetset - Fix handling of workspace target set
  * Bug fixes - utils - Use environment.paths for command lookup instead of process PATH
  * Bug fixes - plans - Return PlanNotFound when plan does not exist in plan-step commands
  * Bug fixes - target-sets - Store canonical manifest paths to fix dependency resolution
  * Bug fixes - tasks - Fix infinite loop and wrong error type in run-all-targets
  * Bug fixes - tasks - Write exit_status file on command launch failure
  * Bug fixes - tasks - Use wrapper script to capture real exit code from asciinema
  * Bug fixes - program - Properly capture the output of the git status --porcelain call to evaluate clean working directory
  * Bug fixes - asciinema - When a step failed or was rewound asciinema failed with an error because the output file already existed
  * Bug fixes - resolve - Exclude dev-dependencies from intra-workspace crate execution order
  * Bug fixes - formatting - Fix formatting
  * Bug fixes - wait_barrier - Include cargo-for-each and task name in suggested continue command
  * Bug fixes - github - Pin action SHAs and scope contents:write to release jobs
  * Bug fixes - run - Use POSIX shell quoting for command and args in wrapper script
  * Bug fixes - file_exists - Restrict path to within enclosing workspace
  * Bug fixes - perms - Write user state/config files with mode 0o600 and dirs 0o700
  * Bug fixes - windows - Restore build and tighten executable detection
  * Bug fixes - clippy - Correct assert_matches path in disallowed-macros
  * Bug fixes - targets - Canonicalize paths and harden remove/refresh
  * Bug fixes - snapshots - Canonicalize manifest key, drop cross-workspace fallback
  * Bug fixes - task-remove - Clean up state dir, return TaskNotFound
  * Bug fixes - task-continue - Validate cursor targets a wait_for_continue
  * Bug fixes - run-step - Propagate exit_status read/parse errors
  * Bug fixes - if-block - Propagate chosen_branch read/parse errors
  * Bug fixes - run-all - Refuse parallel jobs with interactive steps
  * Bug fixes - resolve - Propagate canonicalize errors when computing inter-workspace deps
  * Bug fixes - condition - Surface signal-killed run-condition as an error
  * Bug fixes - wait_barrier - Use to_path_string for human-readable cursor mention
  * Bug fixes - wait_barrier - Add `cargo-for-each` prefix to remaining suggestion site
  * Bug fixes - cursor - Require digits after w/c/s/if prefix in FromStr
  * Bug fixes - evaluate - Use operator-aware separator in runtime detail
  * Bug fixes - tasks - Propagate barrier suspension through scope runners
  * Bug fixes - bin - Support invocation as `cargo for-each` subcommand
  * Bug fixes - config - Atomic writes + flock around load/modify/save
  * Bug fixes - targets - Propagate Config::load errors from list_command
